      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Invocation of the Elements" id="b201-1001-0004-0001" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of each of your Movement phases, an Ethereal may invoke one elemental power. Until the start of your next turn, friendly non-vehicle Tau Empire units within 12&quot; benefit from that power: Storm of Fire grants an extra shot to pulse weapons at half range; Calm of Tides allows failed Morale and Pinning tests to be re-rolled; Zephyr&apos;s Grace grants the Stubborn special rule; and Sense of Stone grants Feel No Pain (6+).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
